'''Metz''' is the chairman of the [[Huntik Foundation]] and was the mentor of [[Dante Vale]] throughout his childhood. For a long period of time, he was bedridden due to the [[Curse of the Legendary Titans]] but, after this was lifted, recovered and returned to his position as the head of the [[Huntik Foundation Council]].

